{"slug":"mark-cuban-and-carlisle-checkout-big-3-in-dallas","postId":73624,"title":"Mark Cuban and Carlisle Checkout Big 3 In Dallas","htmlContent":"&nbsp;\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_507675\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"610\"]<img class=\"wp-image-507675 size-full\" src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/gettyimages-8108935241-e1520607047582.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"610\" height=\"343\" /> Getty Images[/caption]\n\nDallas Mavericks owner Mark Cuban kept his word from earlier this when said he would come to check out a Big 3 game in Dallas. In an interview, Cuban was asked if we could see him at a game this season?\n\nCuban replied, Yeah I need to go check it out I really do. I got to go check out DeShawn [Stevenson].\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/BxAyV7pgcYs/\" data-instgrm-version=\"12\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding: 0 4px;\"><a style=\"color: #000; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none; word-wrap: break-word;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/BxAyV7pgcYs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mark Cuban says he needs to checkout the Big 3 and DeShawn Stevenson when they come to Dallas. #MarkCuban #DallasMavericks #MFFL #Big3 #amytrask #IceCube #deshawnstevenson #Garypayton #Iceman #DrJ #Landonbuford #landonbufordinterviews #TheBig3 #Dallas #NBA #gilbertarenas #JasonTerry #Naterobinson #JoshSmith #chanceybillups   @nikonickk</a></p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">A post shared by <a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/landonbuford/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Landon Buford</a> (@landonbuford) on <time style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\" datetime=\"2019-05-03T19:43:54+00:00\">May 3, 2019 at 12:43pm PDT</time></p>\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script>\n\nOver the weekend, Cuban indeed, was in attendance, but he wasn't alone  Mavericks Coach Rick Carlisle was also in attendance to take in the festivities on Saturday afternoon. <span>Some other</span> celebrities that were in attendance were Yella Beezy, T. I. LL Cool J, and God Shammgod came out to support Ice Cube and the rest of the league.\n\n&nbsp;","excerpt":"[caption id=\"attachment_507675\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"610\"] Getty Images[/caption] Dallas Mavericks owner Mark Cuban kept his word from earlier this when said he would come to check out a Big 3…","publishedAt":"2019-08-18T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2019-08-18T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"big-3","name":"Big 3"},{"slug":"dallas-mavericks","name":"Dallas Mavericks"},{"slug":"deshawn-stevenson","name":"Deshawn Stevenson"},{"slug":"god-shammgod","name":"God Shammgod"},{"slug":"ice-cube","name":"Ice Cube"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"mark-cuban","name":"Mark Cuban"},{"slug":"mffl","name":"MFFL"},{"slug":"rick-carlisle","name":"Rick Carlisle"},{"slug":"t-i-ll-cool-j","name":"T. I. LL Cool J"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/gettyimages-8108935241-e1520607047582.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/gettyimages-8108935241-e1520607047582.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/mark-cuban-and-carlisle-checkout-big-3-in-dallas/"}